      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "During the mid‑20th century, logging in the Satsop Valley shifted from railroads to trucks and tractors, with chainsaws allowing individual loggers to harvest trees more efficiently.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
