      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/satsop_washington",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The first white settler in the Satsop Valley, John Rady, claimed land along the river in 1852, marking the start of non‑Native settlement.",
