        25
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/satsop_washington",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "After World War II, Satsop and the surrounding valley experienced economic expansion fueled by a regional timber boom that met soaring national demand for plywood and lumber.",
